    },
    {
        "text": "Yuki-chan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3",
        "volume": 0.45
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've informed Yenwu. Now, I've arranged for you to enter a pharmaceutical company called Rhodes Island as an operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. You've likely already heard of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only that the Miss has deep ties with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does the Princess want me to protect the Miss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... that has been part of my intent. After all, this is an Infected organization. However, I believe Hui-chieh should be able to handle things herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Infected... does the Princess consider them reliable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Be assured. I've met their leader before. She is quite a good girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've looked into things a little. I feel the company itself is good too. So, I feel this is a good opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Opportunity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. You've followed me since childhood. Even now in Lungmen, you haven't once left my side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It is my mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you also ought to see the sights outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I need only to know what sights the Princess sees.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is an order, Yuki-chan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fumizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
