    {
        "text": "Phew... Wonderful. That's enough training today to hit standards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Midnight"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's late now. Though there are no missions tomorrow, I should quickly do my skincare, and then it's beddy-byes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Midnight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah. Ever since I became an Operator, I haven't been properly managing my appearance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Midnight"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what can you do? Some things are a necessary sacrifice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Midnight"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I suppose even if I don't take care, I'm handsome enough as is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Midnight"
    },
