        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait wait wait! No way! You're meant to kiss right freaking here, aren't you?! What are you hesitating for?! You're the heroine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, come on, one of these scenes is enough! Don't do it every time! What's your PROBLEM, scriptwriter?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Euuugh, I haaate this kind of development... How are they on their seventh season by now? And the reviews get crappier each time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "They're just dragging it out! That's all they're doing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Dammit, but that boy's so hot. And he's in every episode!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. I'll hang in there. Can't say it won't get better!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
