    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chief Engineer Closure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Tis alleged that the Rhodes Island ship was her plan alone. Fearsome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet this is not where the show's true ruin lies. The fourth season's spontaneous introduction of the supporting man; such was a nightmare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? You're kidding me?! I thought this was bad enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...You catch upon my words?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, shoot, I knee-jerked that one out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever, come down here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_118_yuki#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
