    },
    {
        "text": "...Since when?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#5",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#5",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't get me wrong, your ninja techniques are real amazing stuff. Thing is, I just knew you were gonna do this from the start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Twas my individual action, untied to anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#6",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, loosen up. You think I'm treating you as a spy here or something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Princess Fumizuki specially phoned up Amiya when she sent you over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When she did, she told Amiya, even if she had no ulterior motive sending you here, she was worried you might go a little overboard. So, she specifically warned us beforehand to keep our ears perked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "And she gave Amiya a couple details on your MO, so I've been a little extra aware of you the past while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...This has naught to do with the Princess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#6",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Jeez, you are some tough customer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'know, now I get the feeling I can't really talk you over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we actually treated you like a spy, wouldn't Kal'tsit have just dealt with you back there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#2",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Basically, seeing as this is your first offense, don't you worry that anyone's gonna punish you, or that it'll reflect badly on your Princess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I don't recommend you try prowling around Rhodes Island like that again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the one hand, you'd absolutely, aaaaaabsolutely never get into the core. At least, the pipes won't let you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "But on the other hand, snooping into other people's privacy isn't super cool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't you get tired doing that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not repeat this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#2",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're gonna go find some other way instead, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#2",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I make no guarantee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#6",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wowie, do I wanna let Kal'tsit sic you. Loyal people are such a pain in the neck, honestly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But whatever, Kal'tsit wanted me to tell you this instead. 'You may use your methods to observe Rhodes Island, but Rhodes Island is observing you too.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, honestly, if you're so bored at night you wanna roam around, you can come watch these stories with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "text": "You gave me the impression you've done a little research into them. Most of Rhodes Island are all outdoorsy types, and I'm starving for any compatriots of my own. It's killing me, c'mon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In continuing to watch this, you will truly find no value.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "text": "I may recommend some. I know not if you possess them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#5",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lay 'em on me, and if I don't have them, I'll go find them for us to watch together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_007_closre_1#4",
        "name2": "char_118_yuki#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shirayuki"
    },
